# Brenz spec decisions (001–004)

Source: `docs/architecture/brenz-architecture-spec-decisions.md`. This source wins over domain, data and presentation where they differ. It does not override stored-values.

## Rules
- Session decides the destination; `hasLaunchedBefore` only picks splash length and Start → Intro.
- Set `hasLaunchedBefore` once after the first full splash. Never clear `LaunchMarkerStore`.
- Sign Up seeds `[boxing]` and `lastDiscipline = nil`. Keep "at least 1 discipline".
- Derive pet bands from Remote Config `downDays`/`lazyDays`; fall back on invalid values.
- Use the documented timing constants with an injected monotonic clock.
- Keep Intro uncuttable (no skip, 9 s, Reduce Motion from v1).
- Sign In format failures → `invalidCredentials`. No "new equals current" in Change Password v1.
- Own use cases per feature; extend `ProfileRepository`, never duplicate it.
- Message precedence: class-event > new-user > midday > state. Clear rotation on Sign Out and Delete Account.
- Domain holds no localized text; use `DayLabelKind`.

## Forbidden
- Do not add Remote Config keys.
- Do not store derived values.
- Do not create a second `firestore.rules`.
- Do not clear `LaunchMarkerStore` on Sign Out or Delete Account.
- Do not put localized strings in Domain.
